# Project layout

RulePackVersion: 1.3.0

## Unity

- Flag new types in global Interfaces/, Managers/, or Controllers/ buckets when feature folders exist.
- Flag interfaces split from their implementation across unrelated top-level folders.
- Flag namespace/folder mismatch on new files under Assets/.../Scripts/.
- Prefer feature-first layout per EngineeringRulebook unity-project-layout.md.

## .NET

- Flag Core referencing Infrastructure or Ui.
- Flag interfaces defined in Infrastructure that Core depends on (dependency inversion violation).
- Flag new solution-wide Interfaces/ dump folders.
- Prefer layer projects per EngineeringRulebook dotnet-project-layout.md.